        "Currents, soundings, migration. Public gallery on the ground floor."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 14,
      "text": [
        "THE MERIDIAN FOUNDATION - Tideglass Coastal Station.",
        "Storm warning. Ocean survey. Kin conservation. Disaster relief.",
        "Under the list, newer paint: AND WE ARE HIRING"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 66,
      "y": 39,
      "text": [
        "THE DOCKYARDS. Hard hats past this board. Children out of the yards entirely.",
        "Berths eleven to twenty are taken by one charter. It has been the same charter since spring."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 50,
      "text": [
        "THE WEST MOLE. Nine hundred paces of stone and one light at the end of it.",
        "In weather, do not. There is no argument to be had with the sea about it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "sign",
      "x": 16,
